---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | OnlineBeamCalculator.com" description="Privacy policy for OnlineBeamCalculator.com: a fully client-side beam calculator. No account, no tracking of your calculations, no data uploaded to a server.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[48rem] px-lg py-xl">
    <div class="eyebrow uppercase mb-xxs">Legal</div>
    <h1 class="text-display-lg font-semibold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-xxs text-body-sm text-mute">Last updated: August 22, 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-lg space-y-md text-body-md text-body">
      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">The short version</h2>
      <p>OnlineBeamCalculator.com runs entirely in your browser. Your beam models, loads, units and results never leave your device. We do not have accounts, we do not store your calculations on a server, and there is nothing to opt out of because nothing is collected in the first place.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">What we do not collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-md space-y-xxs">
        <li>No personal information such as names, email addresses or account credentials (registration does not exist on this site).</li>
        <li>No calculation data. All structural analysis is computed locally by JavaScript running in your browser. Nothing you enter into the calculator is transmitted to us.</li>
        <li>No advertising or behavioural tracking cookies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Local storage</h2>
      <p>The site stores a small number of preferences in your browser's local storage, such as your theme choice (light or dark) and unit preferences, so they persist between visits. This data stays on your device, is never sent to us, and can be cleared at any time through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Shared links</h2>
      <p>When you share a model via a link, the full model configuration is encoded in the URL itself. Whoever opens the link decodes it locally in their own browser. The link content is not stored in any database operated by us.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p>The site is served as static files through a content delivery network (currently Cloudflare Pages). Like any web host, the CDN may process standard technical data (IP address, user agent, requested URL) in short-lived server logs to deliver pages and protect against abuse. We do not access, combine or retain these logs for profiling.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>Fonts are bundled with the site and served from the same origin. We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand aggregate site usage such as page views and referrers; this involves a script from googletagmanager.com and standard GA cookies. We do not embed advertising networks or social media trackers, and your calculation inputs are never sent to Google or anyone else.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Children</h2>
      <p>The site is an engineering tool directed at a general technical audience. It does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we change how the site handles data, we will update this page and revise the date above. Material changes will be noted on the site.</p>

      <h2 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: see the <a class="text-link hover:underline" href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
